{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01593","headline":"琴曲歌辞 王敬伯歌 · 李端","name":"琴曲歌辞 王敬伯歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾本舟中客，闻君江上琴。\n君初感妾叹，妾亦感君心。\n遂出合欢被，同爲交颈禽。\n传杯惟畏浅，接膝犹嫌远。\n侍婢奏箜篌，女郎歌宛转。\n宛转怨如何，中庭霜渐多。\n霜多叶可惜，昨日非今夕。\n徒结万里欢，终成一宵客。\n王敬伯，渌水青山从此隔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}